     1407   DEFINE VARIABLE E-PS AS CHARACTER
     1408        VIEW-AS EDITOR SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
     1409        SIZE 98 BY 2.75 NO-UNDO.
     1410   DEFINE VARIABLE F-type AS CHARACTER FORMAT "X(256)":U INITIAL "Тип"
